-- 039_import_services_catalog.sql
-- One-time bulk import of the clinic's existing services/tests price
-- list into the catalog (goods_services). Consult/Dental/Surgery/General
-- map to their matching existing Service subcategories; Test items map to
-- their matching existing Test subcategory (X-Ray/Ultrasound/PCR/Blood Test -
-- CBC/Urine) where the name matches, otherwise the new Test/Other subcategory
-- added in 038. 2 of 160 rows skipped for missing a price (Equipment Damage,
-- Spey - Dog Welfare (10%)) — add those by hand once priced. Run this ONCE —
-- re-running will insert duplicates, since goods_services has no unique
-- constraint on name.

